"value":6,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4437800","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3755200-1846651706695305","game_id":"steam-3755200","kind":"announcement","title":"2 Bug-Fixes","summary":"Fixed Ominous Contraption insta-killing player due to Core-Health-Display having a fancy animation (which also actually set the health to 0, not just visually, which was the cause of the bug) Fixed uncovering extra Underground-Actions with your last action wrongly transitioning to day","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T13:38:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695305","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:50:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3755200-1846651706690766","game_id":"steam-3755200","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.2","summary":"Hey everybody,Cannon Keep is participating in October Next Fest!If you haven't already, now is the perfect time to check out the demo! After Next Fest the demo will go offline as we concentrate all our efforts on getting the game ready for release. Change NotesNew Industrial buildingsDisc Shooter, Pneumatic Rifle, Power Plant, Runaway Engine, BonfireNew Military buildings:Minigun Nail Launcher, Heroic Statue, Bulwark, Rallying Banner, Howitzer, Ammunition Crate, Radio Station, Marksmen's GuildNe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:25:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690766","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3755200-1842846814441057","game_id":"steam-3755200","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.8.0","summary":"Hey everybody! We've got some bugfixes, balancing and optimization changes for the Demo: Bugfixes & Optimization:Fixed multiple bugs where enemies could not be targeted or did not dieReworked the combat speed system to make it more consistent and performantFixed a bug where turrets with manual shoot direction did not shoot in the expected direction after rotating themRemoved the option to change the targeting mode on Mine and Air Mine LauncherImplemented various fixes to make the transition from","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T16:59:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441057","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3755200-1840944183780151","game_id":"steam-3755200","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"Hey everybody,It's time for a demo update! After the demo launch in march, we have been steadily improving the game, and it's slowly but surely becoming what we've always wanted it to be! This update brings significant changes to the underground, metaprogression, as well as new content and balancing changes. Underground OverhaulWe changed the resource gathering mechanics to feel more unique and flow better with the rest of the gameplay. Instead of placing miners underground, you now explore, dig","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T16:11:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183780151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3755200-1833968530891708","game_id":"steam-3755200","kind":"announcement","title":"Cannon Keep Playtest 0.5 is open now until Monday!","summary":"Hey everyone!The Playtest is live once again from now until next Monday! To participate, press \"Request Access\" on the Cannon Keep store page, you will be added automatically.Here's what's new:New Buildings: Reforgery, Tire Fire, Flamethrower, Ominous Contraption and Barbed Wire FactoryNew Effects: Burn and CritNew waves with enemies that can apply BuffsRight-clicking enemies during combat reveals their stats and effectsA reworked Building Information panel for more clarityAnd many other small f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T16:40:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530891708","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3755200-1830163047260984","game_id":"steam-3755200","kind":"announcement","title":"Cannon Keep Playtest is open now until Monday!","summary":"Hey everyone!The Playtest is live now until next Monday! To participate, press \"Request Access\" on the Cannon Keep store page, you will be added automatically.Here's what's new:Reworked underground: We're trying a different approach to gathering resources compared to the demo. Try it out and let us know what you think!Metaprogression: Unlock buildings by completing challenges! (The new content we're working on is not quite ready yet, so we added a \"unlock all\" button for those who know the game ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T17:28:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047260984","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3755200-1826992588596314","game_id":"steam-3755200","kind":"update","title":"Demo update","summary":"Hey everyone!First of all, thank you so much for trying out the demo and sending us feedback! It's time for the first demo patch notes! Here's what changed:Endless Mode & Leaderboard:We realised that in the current version of the game, there is simply not enough content and variation to make a standard endless mode interesting. It's a bit too easy to create a build that overpowers any wave the game throws at you, which leads to a long, agonizing battle between your patience and your PC's cooling","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-13T17:27:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588596314","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3755200-1826362059924750","game_id":"steam-3755200","kind":"announcement","title":"Cannon Keep Free Demo Available Now!","summary":"Hey everyone!As a part of the upcoming Steam Tower Defense Fest, the Cannon Keep demo is available right now! Here's what you can expect in the demo:Build your city with buildings from three unique factions!Fight 15 waves up to an epic boss fight!Continue in endless mode and compare your personal best on the leaderboard!Discover powerful relics in the underground!Intervene in fights by targeting specific enemies!That's all for now! We hope you enjoy the demo, and thanks for your support! Don't f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-06T16:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059924750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3755200-1824644522846982","game_id":"steam-3755200","kind":"announcement","title":"Wretched Lead is now Cannon Keep!","summary":"Hey everyone! As you might have noticed, we have changed the name from \"Wretched Lead\" to \"Cannon Keep\". As much as we've grown fond of the old name, we believe \"Cannon Keep\" is much more clear about what the game offers, as you literally build a keep with lots of cannons! Alongside the name change we also took the time to update the screenshots and description, since the old ones were outdated at this point. The game looks quite a bit different in the new screenshots, and not without a reason:W","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-17T08:19:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522846982","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3755200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:33Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:32Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3755200":"2026-10-26T10:59:33Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3755200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:32Z"},"4437800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:33Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3755200","app_id":3755200,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1c7e9af5785e585744f8eb016498937bff0bc6c5be6747c138372a26711edb66","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"도시를 블록 하나씩 건설하고 타워 디펜스 로그라이크에서 밀려오는 메카 웨이브를 물리치세요! 강력한 대포와 고유한 효과를 조합해 가혹한 황무지에서 살아남고, 지하를 탐험해 자원과 강력한 유물을 찾아보세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Brainflick"}],"developers":[{"name":"Brainflick"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1794596400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792675870","